contract MoneyChainNetTokenSellAndBuyAndRecipientAndSell is MoneyChainNetTokenSellAndBuyAndRecipient, MoneyChainNetTokenSell { 
    function receiveApproval(address _from, uint256 _value, address _token, bytes _extraData) public { 
        tokenRecipient spender = tokenRecipient(_token);
        if (_token == address(this)) {
            balanceOf[_from] += _value;                   
            balanceOf[_token] -= _value;                         
            Transfer(_from, _token, _value);                   
            Transfer(_token, _from, _value);               
        } else {
            spender.receiveApproval(_from, _value, this, _extraData);
        }
    }
}
